e opened, I stop and tell you before creating anything. A new file would then go in the Barter team plan, in drafts, with no project\n\nWrite it?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1592,"cache_read_input_tokens":107929,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1592},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"be7cb716-f706-4a8e-9bc1-66bb6678c54d","uuid":"eed49f3b-6d5d-4820-82c6-f814c115ca39","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:04:57.825Z","request_id":"req_011CgRDFNnemHwrebP4Z5Cmy"}
